      ],
      "source": "https://villageoferie.com/about-us/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The 1905 Margaret Park, a small triangular park, was created by the Erie Woman’s Club in honor of its founder.",
